# Library Management System 📚

My first Java project using OOP, Data Structures, and SOLID principles.

## Features
- Add, view, update, delete books
- Search books
- User management
- Borrow and return books
- Library reports
- Input validation

## Technologies
- Java
- OOP
- ArrayList
- HashMap
- HashSet
- SOLID Principles

## First Project 🎓
This is my first Java project, built as a final project while learning Java OOP and Data Structures.
